*               (12518, 12519).
* 23 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux b6186cc (17 Oct 26) S.64 part 2: X (delete the item shown) asks the kernel (K$EDIT.OK, K$EDIT.KIND) for the file it has
*               open before it asks "Delete xx from xx (Y/N)?" and before it locks the record, and a session without the gate (voc.edit,
